"Licensee" means the individual or legal entity that uses the Software,
together with its Affiliates.

"Affiliate" means any entity that controls, is controlled by, or is under
common control with the Licensee, control meaning more than 50% of the voting
rights or control within the meaning of Article L233-3 of the French Commercial
Code.

"Installation" means one set of the Software's services sharing one database.

"License Key" means a key issued by Meteroid that identifies the Licensee and
the features it is entitled to.

"Commercial License" means a paid license to the Software under a separate
agreement with Meteroid, such as an order form or a subscription.

"Free Features" means the features the Software provides without a License
Key, as listed in its documentation.

"Licensed Features" means the features of the Software that require a License
Key granting them.

2. FREE USE

Subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement, Meteroid grants each
Qualifying Organization a non-exclusive, non-transferable, royalty-free license
to:

a) Use the Software, with its Free Features, solely for its internal business
